Package: mcp-server-grafana
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
Description: MCP server for Grafana dashboards, datasources and alerting
 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server giving AI assistants access to a Grafana
 instance: search and manage dashboards, query Prometheus, Loki and other
 datasources, inspect alert rules, incidents, annotations and more.
 .
 This is a packaged build of the upstream grafana/mcp-grafana project. The
 /usr/bin/mcp-server-grafana launcher honours GRAFANA_READ_ONLY=true by
 starting the server with --disable-write.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-grafana
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.6.0),
 mcp-server-grafana (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers Grafana MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-grafana. Installing it registers
 the mcp-server-grafana binary as an available MCP server in the local
 mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
